DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\\nAges: 0-6
 0 months\\nCategory: Play & Games\\n\\nCalling all little monsters! Celebr
 ate Halloween at Pretend City with a day of dancing\, trick-or-treating\, 
 laughter\, and imaginative play. From collecting treats around the city to
  enjoying a fun-filled puppet show\, there&#8217\;s something for every 
 little pumpkin. \nTrick or Treating: 10:30am\, 12pm\, and 2:00pm\n11am: H
 ilarious Halloween Haunt Puppet Show &#8211\; Franklin Hayne’s Marionett
 es  \n1pm-1:15pm: Monster Mash Costume Parade and Dance Party  \n2:30p
 m: Halloween Storytime \nAbout the Play Partner: \nMarionette puppetry i
 s a rare and dying art\, yet Franklin Haynes Marionettes celebrates thirty
  years of pulling heartstrings. Franklin Haynes Marionettes have over two-
 hundred professional handcrafted marionettes&#8211\; a lifetime of dedicat
 ed work. They have thirteen different shows\, so you will get a new and di
 fferent experience each time we come out to you.\\n\\nMore info: https://w
 ww.pretendcity.org/events/mini-monster-mash/
LOCATION:Pretend City Children's Museum - Events\, 29 Hubble\, Irvine\, CA
 \, 92618
URL:https://www.pretendcity.org/events/mini-monster-mash/
